sequenceDiagram
  participant Op as 操作者(窗口后演练)
  participant Job as raya-raya 进程
  participant HB as 心跳文件
  participant Patrol as Bridge 巡视(60s)
  participant Alert as flywheel-alerts 频道
  participant Helper as 恢复 helper
  participant Launchd as launchd
  Op->>Job: kill -STOP <exact pid>(假死,可逆)
  Note over HB: updatedAt 停止推进
  Patrol->>HB: 读快照(第 1 次:stale ≥120s)
  Patrol->>HB: 第 2 次
  Patrol->>HB: 第 3 次(连败阈值到)
  Patrol->>Alert: codex_lead_residency_stalled(lead key raya-raya)
  Patrol->>Helper: --recover(pid, lstart, generation, carrier)
  Helper->>Helper: 三方 digest + pid/lstart/argv/CODEX_HOME 二次核验
  Helper->>Helper: 写 recovery-receipts.jsonl(pre_mutation)
  Helper->>Launchd: kickstart -k gui/<uid>/com.flywheel.lead.raya-raya(有界)
  Launchd->>Job: 换新进程(新 pid)
  Job->>HB: 新 generation 心跳
  Helper-->>Patrol: converged
  Note over Op: 全程 grep com.xrli.raya.brain = 0
